Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tag impressed, Greymon digivolved\Ninto Metal Greymon and defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we were\Ncaught in the Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what\NStrange World will land in.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.64,0:02:15.11,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Koromon's Great Battle in Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we defeated Etemon, something\Nvery strange happened. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must have been pulled\Nthrough some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dimensional opening between\NDigiWorld and this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wherever this one is i bet\Nthat opening's the same
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way i got to digi world\Nbut where are we now they
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look like human beings and\Nthis looks like earth but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it really i don't know\Ni've never been here before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this can't be this looks\Nlike a park i played in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a kid i think we're in\Nmy hometown no way yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the toy factory and\Nthat city hall over there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai i don't mean to cut\Nthe sightseeing tour shirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but have you noticed that I'm\Nnot Metal Greymon anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back to Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels real to... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey. Huh? Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this world for real\Nor am I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to know if\Nyou're a real human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell us, are you a\Nreal girl or a digital girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I see something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now she's going to tell the park police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will they arrest me for making her cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.05,0:03:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pretend you're a soccer ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here so I can\Nchill and figure out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all looks so familiar, Coramont.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for your sake, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how can you be certain that you're not\Njust imagining it in the digi world, Tai?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.45,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}[Odaiba Seaside Park Station]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we'll find out\Nwhen we go to my house and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we go to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, Koromon, this has got to\Nbe the happiest day in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:03:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so cool, I'm finally home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see my family,\Nand when they get a look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll know I'm telling\Nthe truth about DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I hope you're right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll see if the others got\Nhome, too, and hook up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I still had\Nsome of my camp money left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subway's a lot\Nnicer than walking home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, everything looks exactly the way\Nit did on the day I left for camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I live, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty neat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your family's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of families live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's been so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being in DigiWorld,\NI've lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're even\Ngoing to recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't know unless we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember when my mom\Nplanted those flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember buzzing my\Nfriends up on that intercom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to come over and play\Nvideo games and watch TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the time when my dad put\Nour family nameplate on this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those memories won't\Nmean a thing, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we came out of that dimension rift at\Nthe wrong time, What if I no longer exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, can I make a little suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the shoes are here Mom? Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's answering Maybe they're out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where they've gone. Maybe they\Nwent to DigiWorld. That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Tai over here. I'm thirsty.\NSorry it's the last one you should
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have asked for some before i finished\Ndrinking i can't believe he'd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be so stingy i was just joking\Ncry baby really i left you half of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it i sure wish i knew where my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family was and how long i've been gone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh-huh, don't scare me like\Nthat. It's been right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today's august 1st the same day we\Nlanded at digi world we've gone back in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time yeah this is the day the digivices\Ndropped into our hands and this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole crazy adventure began which\Nreminds me that this is also the day
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my mom and dad were planning to visit\Nmy grandmother who lives just outside
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the city see my mom marked the\Ndate on this calendar so she wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget they must have taken my little\Nsister kari with them that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody's home now cool then let's\Njust kick back and wait for them to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come home speaking of time it's time\Nto eat hold your digi horses i've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just learned i'm reliving a day i've\Nalready lived sorry Tai no i'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon i didn't mean to yell but\Nthis same hour minute and second have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already occurred except i'm home this\Ntime does that mean i have a twin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,living in some parallel world what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was that huh here's that hi Tai carrie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're here mom and dad left you\Nhere at home all alone i'm a big girl
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hi Koromon carrie how did you know\Nhis name maybe she knows my name
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because your sister's a lot smarter\Nthan you cut it out Koromon I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how did you know his name was Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I've met him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time he's\Never been out of DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe that's where we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've never been to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DigiWorld, have you? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so. It's near your camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kari has been to DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did have on that camp whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she goes to my camp in the\Nfuture and is sucked into the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digi world like i was but comes\Nback before me oh i don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this moving back and forth from\None time dimension to another is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mega whacked no one's ever sure\Nwhether they're here or now or or
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:08:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there and then sometimes i feel\Nmore like i'm where and when
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather than here or there what did\Ni just say i'm confusing myself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i know maybe carrie and i have\Na fever and we're both delirious
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's wrong Tai nothing then why\Ndo you think i have a fever huh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sick, and I've been to DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where else could you find a\NKoromon? The toy store? Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better call everyone else's\Nhouse to see if they got home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, is Izzy there, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Summer camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came home from camp early, and I\Njust wanted to see if Izzy did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everything's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you haven't heard from Sora\Nsince she left for summer camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt hasn't called home or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:09:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm the only one\Nwho got pulled through that rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody else is still\Nstuck in DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Izzy were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could get this Digivice to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I could go back to\NDigiWorld and rescue the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just gotta be a way to\Nfix this time dimension thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, I know you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's food in the fridge, or you\Ncan have my leftover piece of pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get fresh dips this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make us a healthy breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you never cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you learn to camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my new friend Matt taught me when\Nour summer camp switched to DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys can eat the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I am so full I won't have to\Neat for at least a year. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So full!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better go rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hide in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to hang out\Nwith someone who's such a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to hear what\Nhappened to me at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took a farm field trip and I\Nslipped and fell in a pig pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kids were laughing\Nat me till Tai jumped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He played in the mud with me like\NI'd really done it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai does bug me sometimes, but he is\Nthe coolest big brother in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to hate that wind chime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:11:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I really miss sitting around\Nwatching TV with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss Mom scolding Dad for\Nnot hanging up his shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, it's good to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable weather conditions around the\Nworld have all weather experts puzzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is still no rainfall\Nin Southeast Asia,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all the rice paddies are drying up as\Na result of the record-setting drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the Middle East,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,major flooding continues to wreak\Nhavoc for a concerned populace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile in America, snow falls\Nin a freak midsummer cold spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is Frigimon doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could somebody please tell\Nme what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon are clearly on the TV screen,\Nbut the reporter hasn't mentioned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, somebody else can see them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you can\Nsee the monsters too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a long time now Mom and\Ndad don't believe me They
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just think that I watch\Ntoo many scary movies Kari
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Digivice has activated itself. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the computer, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, danger Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, I need help with the Digi-Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, wherever you may\Nbe, don't come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave you guys there, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be your only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Total chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, I need help with the Digivice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better off where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy! Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're here safe at home,\Nmy friends are in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:12:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two worlds are in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can't do a thing about it I feel\Ntotally useless I know this digivice is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful enough to do something But I\Ndon't have a clue on how to make it work
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I guess I should just quit while\NI'm ahead But, Tai, you can't Why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.17,0:13:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,throw the digivice at the monsters\Nand hope they get scared and run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax Eat some watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corrie's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do need to relax and chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe an idea of what to\Ndo will come to me. I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh boy, if there's one thing I\Nduly love, I duly love this watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can eat all you want, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'd need another slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This roll is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it here on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you may be\Nstaying here for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not be returning to\NDigi-World anytime soon, if at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you are more than welcome\Nto live with us forever
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't hit me until just now\NI may never get back to my home
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might be a little later than planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's supposed to be a storm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there might be some heavy\Ntraffic coming back into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and your grandparents want you and\NTai to come visit when you get well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you still there,\Nhoney? Mom? What? Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth is in just as much\Ndanger as the Digi-World. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-World's troubles are\Nslipping through the dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do until\NI figure out how to use the Digi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-Vice so we can return to Digi-World\Nand fight the bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll be okay for now, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be a nice break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we have all kinds of\Nfood and candy and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we get to sleep in a soft bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be living large.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Digi-Bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's lots of\Nthings to do out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That satellite dish is more in\Ntouch with the world than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could go to the beach, the\Nmovies, take curry shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are in danger\Nbecause I can't make this piece
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of techno junk work and I\Ncan't do a thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it Seadramon again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Tyrannomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me and Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She stays here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, don't leave for any reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon and I have to find\Nthat dimensional rift!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta find a way\Nback to Digi-World! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened? He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Drimogemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.47,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(488,98)}{\frz10}{\t(0,209,\fs22)}Odaiba's Daytime Plus
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.51,0:16:41.06,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(518,230)}{\frz10}{\t(0,54,\fs22)}Earthquake Report{1st flash}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of our viewers have\Ncalled into our station
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.47,0:16:42.06,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\pos(518,230)}{\frz10}{\t(0,54,\fs22)}Earthquake Report{2nd flash}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.47,0:16:45.31,Sign,,300,0,240,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\frz10}Odaiba's Summer Gourmet Spots\NSpecial Edition
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.47,0:16:45.31,Sign,,300,0,140,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\frz10}There was an earthquake at around 1:10 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,claiming to have seen monsters\Non our newscast screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Authorities believe this is merely a\Nbit of hysteria among a few individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you see these monsters, you\Nshould seek medical attention immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon are drifting\Nback and forth between
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both worlds through that dimensional rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find it and\Nget through it before
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those monsters destroy\NEarth and Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take all of us working\Ntogether to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we did, I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In spite of all I've eaten, I can't\Nseem to Digivolve, so I can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win unless we fight as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, Koromon, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, I told you not to leave home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogremon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, Kari, it's Ogremon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the people don't seem to notice him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just standing there\Nwaiting for the light to change
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we wait, he'll\Ndisappear like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to fight that\Nmonster single-handed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it unless you use the digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's wrong, but\Nthe digivice isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to digivall without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Coralmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coralmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!\NDigimon! Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the dimensional rift's opening\Nup like a mega vacuum cleaner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepperbred!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still need my help. Agumon, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, go wait for Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. Why? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon can't digivolve without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was really hard to watch kari\Nas i floated away but there was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no way i could have taken her with\Nme i knew it was way too risky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,besides mom would have been really\Nmad at me if i had but what i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't know is that kari would\Nsoon find her own way to digi world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, we're back in business Now we've\Ngot to decide what our first move is Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to find our friends Then we\Nhave to make sure you and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get home safely Not until we conquer\Nall the evil Digimon Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,neither one of our\Nworlds will ever be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you were here, do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. You wish. You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was in the place in the\Nmiddle of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did everyone go to where they went?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in the river where\Nthey went to the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that time, there was a secret\Nto Takeru and Tokomon's friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:22:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next episode of Digimon Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we're going to have a dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.23,0:23:05.06,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Whispering Little Demon, PicoDevimon!

